od?\n\nMay men take power into their own hands - even to do the work of redemption - without submitting first to the will of God? More particularly, Buber unfolds the inner world of messianic longing and expectations that characterized Judaism then and continues to characterize it to the present day."},"latest_revision":11,"revision":11,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2026-07-04T15:24:50.157969"}}},"ISBN:9781000086676":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781000086676","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL29515636M/Ten_Rungs","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL29515636M/Ten_Rungs","details":{"publishers":["Taylor & Francis Group"],"subtitle":"Collected Hasidic Sayings","source_records":["bwb:9781000086676"],"title":"Ten Rungs","number_of_pages":104,"isbn_13":["9781000086676"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"full_title":"Ten Rungs Collected Hasidic Sayings","lc_classifications":[""],"publish_date":"2020","key":"/books/OL29515636M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL22736A","name":"Martin Buber"}],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL12311W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"latest_revision":3,"revision":3,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-08-26T15:25:59.739014"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-10-12T10:23:47.194351"}}},"ISBN:9781134458097":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781134458097","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33792104M/Ten_Rungs","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33792104M/Ten_Rungs","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL22736A","name":"Martin Buber"}],"isbn_13":["9781134458097"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"number_of_pages":104,"publish_date":"2013","publishers":["Taylor & Francis Group"],"source_records":["bwb:9781134458097"],"title":"Ten Rungs","subtitle":"Collected Hasidic Sayings","full_title":"Ten Rungs Collected Hasidic Sayings","works":[{"key":"